+This fork of [Nokse22/teleprompter](https://github.com/Nokse22/teleprompter)
+adds playback of SubRip (`.srt`) files. It displays the script using the file's
+original cue times, with the current cue in large, bold text and the upcoming
+cue in a smaller preview. Ordinary scrolling text is also supported.
 
-## Installation
+## Build and launch this fork
 
-### From the stores
+The upstream Flathub download does not include this fork's changes. Build this
+checkout to use SRT playback.
 
-Teleprompter is available to download on Flathub.
+### Linux Mint: build with Flatpak Builder
 
-<a href='https://flathub.org/apps/details/io.github.nokse22.teleprompter'><img width='240' alt='Download on Flathub' src='https://flathub.org/assets/badges/flathub-badge-en.png'></a>
+You need Git, Flatpak, and Flatpak Builder. On Mint, install any missing tools:
 
-### From source
+```sh
+sudo apt install git flatpak flatpak-builder
